###  https://l-jamora.github.io/sdco#OtherPipelineThroughManhole
:OtherPipelineThroughManhole rdf:type owl:Class ;
                             rdfs:subClassOf :Inventory ;
                             rdfs:comment """To describe DCL.

DCL !There is another wastewater pipeline through the manhole or inspection  chamber.  The connections to the manhole or inspection chamber joined to each end of the pipeline should be coded using DCA and DCG.\" Characterisation 1 There is:  no access to the pipe (A); access is provided – cover in place (B);  !access is provided – cover missing (C).\"  Characterisation 2 !The pipeline is:\"  defective (A); not defective (B)."""@en .


